      "timestamp_raw": "Nov 14, 2024 12:29:13 GMT -5",
      "body_html": "The population from Ware Co, GA has so many gems when it comes to color forms!  While these don't size up as easily as the Charlton Co, GA population, their lack of height is more than compensated by their coloration!<br/><br/>S. minor var. okefenokeensis (various red clones) Ware Co, GA, photos taken Nov. 2024:<br/><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54135934525_09968c6f30_z.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54135761953_6e96a69d09_z.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/>Notice the green coloration near the bottom of the leaf.  Anything that is shaded doesn't turn red!<br/><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54134630192_3bc53d0642_z.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54135760833_11ce9d65c1_z.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54135758848_31cef79f06_z.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54135475641_eb31b776bd_z.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54135933030_75df0b093d_z.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/54134628877_d8124a34e9_z.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/>",
      "body_text": "The population from Ware Co, GA has so many gems when it comes to color forms!  While these don't size up as easily as the Charlton Co, GA population, their lack of height is more than compensated by their coloration!\nS. minor var. okefenokeensis (various red clones) Ware Co, GA, photos taken Nov. 2024:\nNotice the green coloration near the bottom of the leaf.  Anything that is shaded doesn't turn red!",
